    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6930" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀναλογ-ισμός</span></b> , ὁ,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>reconsideration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				3.36
			</span></i>; <i>reckoning, calculation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				8.84
			</span></i>; <i>course</i> or <i>line of reasoning,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.1.19
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ πρὸς αὑτὸν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					447
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιλογισμός,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Stoic.</u>
				2.89
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ τὸν ἀ.</span> according to
				<i>proportionate reckoning,</i> Docum. ap. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				18.106
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δι᾽ ἀναλογισμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					1.147
				</span></i>
			.</div>
